flowchart TD
    USER[User]
    APP[CampusAssist Application]
    VALIDATE[Input Validation]
    LIMIT[1000 Character Query Limit]
    DATA[Synthetic Document Dataset]
    SECRETS[Secret File Exclusion via gitignore]
    LOGS[Streamlit Cloud Application Logs]

    USER --> APP
    APP --> VALIDATE
    VALIDATE --> LIMIT
    LIMIT --> DATA
    APP --> LOGS
    SECRETS -. Repository protection rule .-> APP

    NOTE[Authentication, RBAC and advanced security monitoring are not implemented]
    APP -. Current limitation .-> NOTE
